  "sentence_method": "one complete sentence per generation",
  "word_method": "independent word generation, not extracted from sentence audio",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "The night sky is our earliest library.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "There, we stored our knowledge, and passed it down around the fire, before we invented the written word.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "I remember going to the local university for an astronomy night when I was a child.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "That night, I saw Saturn, one of the planets, and its rings with my own eyes for the first time.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The rings shone bright against the blackness of space and suddenly the universe wasn't something that you only read about or imagined in your head.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "It was right there, and you were a part of it.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "That moment is priceless.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "I admired the beauty of the stars and felt a deep connection with the night sky.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "While starlight is good, light pollution here on Earth can be a real problem.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "For the past 200 years or so, we have used too much electricity to make the night brighter.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "In our busy cities, street lamps and city lights can block our view of the stars, making it almost impossible to see them.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "Luckily, some cities have taken action, like setting up new lights along the streets that direct downwards.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "I hope more cities will join in and continue the practice of controlling unnecessary lighting.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "This way, we can enjoy the peace and beauty of the universe.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-14.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
